---
code: dorc-sh-exec-failed
when-fires: dorc-sh could not exec stock sh. cli/bin/dorc-sh.rs. PASSTHROUGH {detail}.
why: the strip succeeded and the environment failed: distinguishing that from a script error is the difference between fixing the host and hunting a bug that is not there.
edit-loop: edit a sentence in the transcript below, then run `mise run loom:compile -- dorc-sh-exec-failed && mise run loom:promote -- dorc-sh-exec-failed`. `mise run loom:vars -- --all dorc-sh-exec-failed` lists this case's values; type {{name}} to insert or move one.
---
-- replay --
$ dorc plan --book=webhost.sh
error[dorc-sh-exec-failed]: sm cannot exec sh: No such file or directory (os
error 2)
